  "task": "I want to launch \"WashLoop\", a laundry service shop app. The shop collects laundry from customers (same-day or next-day pickup), washes, folds, dry-cleans and irons it, and customers collect at the shop - home return delivery is out of scope for v1. We need a full functional specification: the end-to-end process flow, use cases, functional and non-functional requirements, roles, glossary, integrations (Stripe, Apple/Google Pay, Twilio SMS/email, our POS API for inventory and pricing), KPIs and a process diagram. Native iOS and Android apps plus a lightweight web admin portal. Budget is $15k-$18k over 12 weeks, around 200 active customers per week.",
